    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔥 Crypto RSS Aggregation (with Fallback)\n\nThis module aggregates news from multiple crypto RSS sources using a fault-tolerant two-layer design.\n\nPrimary Flow:\n- RSS Read (Continue On Fail)\n- Error Check\n\nFallback Flow (activated when RSS fails: 403, Cloudflare, HTML response, invalid XML):\n- Browser-like HTTP Request\n- XML → JSON Parsing\n- Data Normalization (title, link, pubDate, description, source)\n\nFinal Step:\n- Merge normalized data into a unified and consistent feed output.\n\nResult:\nA robust and reliable crypto news pipeline that continues to function even when upstream RSS endpoints are unstable or blocked.\n",
        "height": 4432,
        "width": 2240
      },
